hermes-lang-ko

The Korean strings in locales/ko.desktop.yaml are an independent translation by
Dante Labs, prepared with AI assistance from the English Desktop catalog of
NousResearch/hermes-agent (MIT License). The key names and the English source
text they translate belong to hermes-agent.

Releases up to and including 0.1.1 were instead generated from the Korean Desktop
catalog proposed in NousResearch/hermes-agent pull request #40716 by @dalgme and
contributors (MIT License). Those releases keep that attribution. Starting with
0.2.0, no strings from that catalog are included.
